#0
The Void~
   You drift in a vast and silent emptiness.  There is no floor beneath
your feet, no sky above your head, and no sound save the slow beat of
your own heart.  Whether you are floating in nothing or nothing is
floating around you, you cannot quite decide.  Far above you hangs a
shimmering portal, its edges rippling like the surface of a disturbed
pool, the only thing in this void that seems truly real.
~
