#6
Rigorous Nine~
   You are in a cage suspended over some kind of abyss of darkness.
Above you a great chain stretches up into infinite blackness, and a
bluish light seeps from the ceiling of the cage.  You try to call out,
but the sound fades into nothing.  A sick, black feeling of despair
settles over you as you realize that you are stuck here by a god's
command until they take pity on your soul, or until you rot away as
Time's fingers shred you to pieces...
~
