#10
The Social Gathering Room~
   This elegantly decorated room has one simple purpose: to bring
everyone together in one central location.  Deep, comfortable chairs are
gathered in loose circles around low tables, and the walls are hung with
rich tapestries in warm reds and golds.  The murmur of past
conversations seems to linger in the air, and the whole room feels
relaxed and welcoming.  A staircase leads back down to the Immortal
Board Room.
~
