#11
Kirahn's Realm~
   You are floating in a black void.  The screams and bellows of a thousand
tortured souls burns silently in your mind.  A cloaked figure appears far
off within the void and slowly comes closer.  He sits upon a black throne
of skulls with two dark angels floating on both sides of the throne.  
Throwing back the hood to his cloak, The Bloodlord reveals himself.  You 
open your mouth to speak but choke on your own words as Kirahn lifts one 
hand and quiets you.  You are mentally warned not to speak until spoken to.
~
