Sand's Stormcloud~
   You are within a black storm cloud, hovering somewhere above the
Great Desert.  Magic winds somehow allow stability here, and the cloud
almost feels like the firm ground you are use to.  Only the movement of
what appears to be the floor reminds you that you are not on stable dirt.
At the west end of the chamber is a hole allowing you to see the stillness
of the desert below.  There is a picture and a mural on two of the other
walls.  An hourglass sits on a jet black pedestal in the center of the
room.
~
