#15
Garou's Clearing~
      Slipping through the fabric of reality, you find yourself floating in
a swirl of fog, shadow, and mist.  Red eyes stare out at you from all sides
and the sounds of the creatures of the night echo softly off of walls you 
cannot see.  The footing below you seems to indicate that you're on the 
floor of a forest clearing of some kind, but as to where, or even when, you
are, it's impossible to say.  Below you are several soft wolf-skin mats, w 
which you may stop and rest on for awhile.  But you are wary, for somewhere
in these shadows you get the distinct impression that something more than
human is watching.  You find yourself beginning to wonder just what kind of
pets a God like the Kinnslayer keeps for company......
~
