Kerus' Chambers~
     You stand now in the inner chambers of the Arbitrator of Dominion.
You can look out on all the realms within the vast land.  From the Castles
to the east, to the giant mountains of the west.  Nothing is out of this
rooms sight.  The room is dimly lit by a large stone fire pit in the middle
of the room.  Pictures depicting Dominions dark ages are arranged on the
walls.  The wars of the Garouite and Grayites, the Crusades against the 
  religion of Gray, and the final fall into darkness under the rule of
the Grayites.  Before you is the great throne of the Arbitrator, you
can see the Arbitrator will not let the realms go unruled again.
~
