appears to be in perfect order and harmony.  The sky is the perfect blend
of just the right colors, so that it constantly looks like dusk.  The trees
have been arranged to form complex patterns all around, not one branch seems
out of place.  All of the creatures that you see create a perfect balance in
the ecosystem.  You feel one with land here.
