Realm of Dread~
   As you step into this plane you feel a heavy weight descend upon your 
soul, seeming to crush the life from your mortal body.  In the distance
banshees wail out in a song of pain, worshiping their master.  Looking to
your right you see a giant throne formed from bones of various races, 
some with flesh still clinging to them in a web of blood.  A putrid smell
assaults your nostrils, the smell of decaying flesh.
~
