stones tombstones graves gravestones~
     As you look at the stones, the dim light allows you to see some of the
names etched into the graves: Corr......Syndia......Cyboth....Eliyanax...and,
hello.....what's this?  One of the graves has been opened, seemingly clawed
out from the inside.  As if the owner of the grave woke up and hauled his or
herself out of the pit with their bare hands.  The headstone itself has been
shattered, but you can see that when put together, the fragments would read
"Gangrel".  Odd....the name sounds familiar for some reason....
~
